/* i18n.js
   Translation dictionary for the Fairtrade cocoa household data capture tool.
   Three languages: en (English, source of truth), fr (French), es (Spanish).

   NOTE ON SOURCE FILE: the "hired labour services" dropdown in the original
   workbook had French and English option lists that did not line up (16
   French agronomic terms mapped row-by-row onto 7 unrelated English terms,
   e.g. "désherbage" (weeding) was paired with "pruning"). That list has been
   rebuilt here from the French terms, which were the more complete set, with
   correct English and Spanish equivalents. Everything else below reuses the
   French terms exactly as they appear in the workbook's own dropdown sheet.
   Spanish is a first machine-translated draft and needs review by a native
   speaker before real field use, same as the COSP tool's Portuguese/Spanish.
*/

